    <div class=\"feedback feedback-neutral\">\n                        <div class=\"feedback-quote\">\"Woke up to an email saying continue.dev has been acquired by Cursor\"</div>\n                        <div class=\"feedback-source\">— Hacker News (neutral)</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feedback feedback-positive\">\n                        <div class=\"feedback-quote\">\"Continue.Dev has taken some serious notes from Cursor\"</div>\n                        <div class=\"feedback-source\">— Reddit (positive)</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feedback feedback-negative\">\n                        <div class=\"feedback-quote\">\"Why the Cursor Acquisition Should Concern Every Software Developer\"</div>\n                        <div class=\"feedback-source\">— Reddit (negative)</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://devin.ai/desktop/\" target=\"_blank\">Devin: Devin Desktop Launch</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Cognition introduced Devin Desktop in June 2026, transforming the Windsurf interface into an agent command center. The AI-assisted automation input now shows incremental generating steps as it builds automation workflows. Users can manage fleets of local and cloud agents from one surface.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-06-15</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feedback feedback-positive\">\n                        <div class=\"feedback-quote\">\"Devin Desktop allows users to plan, delegate, review, and ship without leaving your editor\"</div>\n                        <div class=\"