4-2359\" target=\"_blank\">Browser Compatibility Database in SQLite</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Converting MDN browser compatibility data to SQLite with Claude Code assistance. 66MB database available via GitHub CDN.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Blog</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#entry-20260624-2359\">Simon Willison</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">github</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">mozilla</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">datasette</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#entry-20260624-1813\" target=\"_blank\">LLM-Generated Job Applications</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        LLM-generated job applications are generic and impersonal, telling nothing about the person other than tool usage.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Blog</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#entry-20260624-1813\">Tom MacWright</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">careers</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ai-misuse</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#entry-20260622-2359\" target=\"_blank\">Prompt Injection as Role 