624-2359\" target=\"_blank\">Browser Compatibility Database in SQLite</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Converting MDN browser compatibility data to SQLite with Claude Code assistance. 66MB database available via GitHub CDN.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Blog</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#entry-20260624-2359\">Simon Willison</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">github</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">mozilla</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">datasette</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#entry-20260624-1813\" target=\"_blank\">LLM-Generated Job Applications</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        LLM-generated job applications are generic and impersonal, telling nothing about the person other than tool usage.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Blog</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#entry-20260624-1813\">Tom MacWright</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">careers</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ai-misuse</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#entry-20260622-2359\" target=\"_blank\">Prompt Injection as Role Confusion</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Research shows models take text style more seriously than content. 'Destyling' reduces attack success from 61% to 10%.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Blog</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#entry-20260622-2359\">Simon Willison</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">jailbreaking</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">prompt-injection</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#entry-20260622-2343\" target=\"_blank\">Moebius Image Inpainting in Browser</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Ported Moebius 0.2B image inpainting model to run using WebGPU in the browser with Claude Code assistance.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Blog</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#entry-20260622-2343\">Simon Willison</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">browsers</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">webgl</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">claude-code</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>Generated by Agentic Coding Research Report • <a href=\"#\">Archive</a> • <a href=\"#\">About</a></p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
